<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 26.16 to 6773.06.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.15 to 409.89.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.12.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1233 to 1219.</p>
<p>Volume was 519,380,890 compared with 577,777,210 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
